The '''Personal Vault''' (also called '''Vault''') is a personal storage located in the {{zone|Bank}}.

== Description ==
The '''Personal Vault''' can be permanently unlocked by paying {{c|10,000}}. Up to {{Green|27}} items can be stored inside. Stored items can't be accessed by co-op members, similarly to an [[Ender Chest]]. Additionally, players may access the '''Personal Vault''' via the [[Personal Bank]] when unlocked.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
* The '''Personal Vault''' plays a chest opening sound when accessing.
*The '''Personal Vault''' can store items that cannot be stored in a [[Backpack]] or [[Ender Chest]], such as the {{Item|Builder's Wand}}, {{Item|Builder's Ruler}}, {{Item|Basket of Seeds}}, or {{Item|Nether Wart Pouch}}.

